## File Traversal 

cd - change directory 
cd .. - back
cd /etc where system wide data exists 
pwd - print working directory 
find - Linux Search keyword syntax ' find ~ -name filename ' where ~ is starting point home dir and -name is directory search type 
ls - List 
ls -l - List in more detail/ Long
ls -al - List **all** long
whoami - what username
uname - OS kernl name 
uname -a - system detail in more detail

